18:43:32.987 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
18:43:32.988   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
18:43:32.988   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
18:43:32.988   the client freezes on 'Connecting...'.
