18:43:32.989   carrying the character's real record (presence[0] the stat block, presence[2]
18:43:32.989   the equipped list), 0x00DC with that field's NPCs and mobs, 0x00D1 with the
18:43:32.989   portal's destination, 0x00E7 with the !map GM command, and 0x0151 with a
18:43:32.989   script Say. Equipment, mobs and the Say are BUILT BUT UNCONFIRMED on screen.
